● A young, friendly, dynamic, and well-equipped environment to be creative;
● Chance to work on exciting projects and work with fascinating overseas clients.
● Work closely with various iCondo team members in Singapore, Australia and
Indonesia;
● Overseas travel opportunities for working related.
Work Location:
Pho Quang, Tan Son Hoa Ward, Ho Chi Minh City

description:
